Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Permissions|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Organization Reg Role
Priority: 4
	Given Permissions set Up Reg Role Login User CP
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	When Permissions define Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|CONTROL_PANEL_USERS_USERS_AND_ORGANIZATIONS_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ACCESS_IN_CONTROL_PANEL_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Access in Control Panel|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And UsersAndOrganizationsNavigator goto Organizations
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'UsersAndOrganizations#ADD'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'You do not belong to an organization and are not allowed to view other organizations.' at locator 'Message#INFO'
	And Permissions define Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|CONTROL_PANEL_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ADD_ORGANIZATION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Add Organization|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And Organization add CP
		|orgName|Organization Name|
		|orgType|Organization|
	And Permissions remove Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|CONTROL_PANEL_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ADD_ORGANIZATION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Add Organization|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	Then AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'UsersAndOrganizations#ADD'
Scenario: Add User Reg Role
Priority: 4
	Given Permissions set Up Reg Role Login User CP
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	When Permissions define Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|CONTROL_PANEL_USERS_USERS_AND_ORGANIZATIONS_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ACCESS_IN_CONTROL_PANEL_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Access in Control Panel|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And UsersAndOrganizationsNavigator goto Organizations
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'You do not belong to an organization and are not allowed to view other organizations.' at locator 'Message#INFO'
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'UsersAndOrganizations#ADD'
	And Permissions define Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|CONTROL_PANEL_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ADD_USER_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Add User|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And User add CP
		|userEmailAddress|userea1@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn1|
		|userLastName|userln1|
		|userScreenName|usersn1|
	And Permissions remove Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|CONTROL_PANEL_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ADD_USER_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Add User|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Users
		|portlet|Users and Organizations|
	And UsersAndOrganizationsNavigator goto Organizations
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'You do not belong to an organization and are not allowed to view other organizations.' at locator 'Message#INFO'
	Then AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'UsersAndOrganizations#ADD'